# A workspace's own corpora, world models and service list are INPUTS, not
# derived artefacts, so they are meant to be committed in the repo they describe.
# This repo is the tool, not a workspace: what is under .bundlebox/ here is a
# fixture from developing it, and committing it would ship one machine's local
# state as if it were part of the package.
.bundlebox/cookbook/
.bundlebox/genesis/
.bundlebox/runbook/
.bundlebox/simulate/
.bundlebox/frames/
.bundlebox/failsafe/
.bundlebox/blackice/
